{"path":"string/basic_string/pop_back","title":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::pop_back","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>pop_back","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string/pop_back","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Removes the last character from the string.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> pop_back<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Removes the last character from the string.\n</p><p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">erase<span class=\"br0\">(</span>end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. The behavior is undefined if the string is empty.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws nothing.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>In libstdc++, <code>pop_back()</code> is <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/libstdc++/manual/strings.html#strings.string.shrink\" data-external=\"1\">not available</a> in C++98 mode.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> str<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Short string!\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Before: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/quoted\"><span class=\"kw1819\">std::<span class=\"me2\">quoted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>str<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>str.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">13</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    str.<span class=\"me1\">pop_back</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"After:  \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/quoted\"><span class=\"kw1819\">std::<span class=\"me2\">quoted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>str<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>str.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">12</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    str.<span class=\"me1\">clear</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//  str.pop_back(); // undefined behavior</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Before: \"Short string!\"\nAfter:  \"Short string\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue534\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 534</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\">std::basic_string</a></span> did not have the member function <code>pop_back()</code>\n</td>\n<td>added\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/push_back\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>push_back</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  appends a character to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/erase\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>erase</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  removes characters <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/basic_string","title":"std::basic_string"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::pop_back","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Removes the last character from the string."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws nothing."},{"label":"Notes","note":"In libstdc++, pop_back() is not available in C++98 mode."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"push_back","note":"appends a character to the end"},{"label":"erase","note":"removes characters"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":151,"codeBlockCount":2}
